WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,060
Daddy Xiaoxia has a stomachache

2
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:05,140
I still can’t hold my urine in my pocket

3
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:06,620
What are you and the others talking about?

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:07,660
That's about to give birth

5
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:10,020
Go and ask Mrs. Zhang to wait outside.

6
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,580
Go see what's going on and bring me the money.

7
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,660
Don't be blown away by the wind

8
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:19,100
Daddy, daddy, the yard is full of snakes

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,510
September day

10
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:23,750
Where do all these long worms come from?

11
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:26,020
It's for the kids in the house.

12
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,740
Dad, what should I do? What should I do? Just scream.

13
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,220
Bring me my scissors

14
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,900
Any snake that comes near me, I kill it.

15
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:37,090
This scissor has been used for a lifetime, and it means that people are stained with yin energy.

16
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:38,410
Even evil ghosts hide from these scissors.

17
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,520
I want to see what you want to do

18
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:52,900
This impermanence demands life

19
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,060
These long worms

20
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,500
He's stopping them

21
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:02,920
Jie Zi, come out and give me a look at this snake.

22
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:06,360
You killed them all. Stop talking nonsense and find some woven bags.

23
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,440
Clean up the yard quickly

24
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:17,690
What happened again?

25
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:19,980
Dad is busy
